Docker networks

1) Bridge(Default network)
  Default network
  Used when you run container normally
  Allows container-to-container communication

 docker network create my_network
 docker run -d --name app1 --network my_network nginx
 docker run -d --name app2 --network my_network_2 nginxHost

docker network create -d bridge --subnet 172.18.0.0/16 --gateway 172.18.0.1 test_network
docker run -id --name tomcat_war2 -p 8800:8080 --network test_network multisatge_docker:2.0
docker network ls 
docker network connect test_network nginx
now from app1 we can ping app2


